From: Salty <99386653+PjSalty@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 03:39:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] cache: add EF second level cache packages

Intent: bring EFCoreSecondLevelCacheInterceptor and its StackExchange.Redis
provider into the publish output so the provider can cache query results in
Valkey or Redis.
Drop when: upstream ships a second level cache of its own.
Ceiling: pinned at 5.3.7, constrained from both sides. 5.3.8+ moves
AsyncKeyedLock past the server's own 7.1.8 pin and the host-loaded copy then
fails the plugin's higher bind (FileLoadException at cache bootstrap).
5.3.12+ moves StackExchange.Redis to 3.x, colliding with the host
Microsoft.Extensions 9.0.11 pins (NU1605). Bump only with the server.
---
 .../Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql.csproj                  | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql.csproj b/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql.csproj
index a19f066..b45bc0f 100644
--- a/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql.csproj
+++ b/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql/Jellyfin.Plugin.Pgsql.csproj
@@ -37,6 +37,21 @@
     </PackageReference>
   </ItemGroup>
 
+  <ItemGroup>
+    <!-- Second level cache: must reach the publish output, so no PrivateAssets.
+         Pinned at 5.3.7, constrained from BOTH sides:
+         - 5.3.8+ moves AsyncKeyedLock to 8.x, but the Jellyfin host loads its
+           own AsyncKeyedLock (7.1.8) into the default context first and the
+           plugin's higher reference then fails to bind (FileLoadException).
+           The plugin's AsyncKeyedLock must EQUAL the server's pin.
+         - 5.3.12+ moves StackExchange.Redis to 3.x, which requires
+           Microsoft.Extensions.* 10.x and collides with the host 9.0.11 pins
+           (NU1605).
+         Bump only together with the server's own dependency pins. -->
+    <PackageReference Include="EFCoreSecondLevelCacheInterceptor" Version="5.3.7" />
+    <PackageReference Include="EFCoreSecondLevelCacheInterceptor.StackExchange.Redis" Version="5.3.7" />
+  </ItemGroup>
+
   <ItemGroup>
     <PackageReference Include="SerilogAnalyzer" Version="0.15.0" PrivateAssets="All" />
     <PackageReference Include="StyleCop.Analyzers" Version="1.2.0-beta.556" PrivateAssets="All" />
